Description: GTK screen and microphone recorder prototype
 DeskRecordor is an early-stage desktop screen and microphone recorder.
 .
 This package provides a GTK 4 and Libadwaita interface and an FFmpeg-based
 capture prototype. The Wayland portal recording flow is not yet complete.
